          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "છપાવવું — chapāvvũ — \"to get (something) printed; to publish\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લેખકે પોતાની નવલકથા છપાવી. lekhke potānī navalkathā chapāvī. The author had his novel published."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે પુસ્તક છપાવ્યું, teṇe pustak chapāvyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
