          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "છપાવવું (chapāvvũ) is the causative of છાપવું, to print, from chapp, \"press, cover\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 4994): to have a printer print it. The long ā of છાપવું shortens in the longer verb."
