          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ભજવવું (bhajavvũ) No dictionary we use records an older form, so its history is not settled. Actors નાટક ભજવે છે, put on a play, and each પાત્ર ભજવે છે, plays a part."
